  "faq": {
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "subtitle": "Everything you need to know about Smart SAP Support",
    "q1": "How does the AI matching work?",
    "a1": "Our AI engine analyzes your support request, identifies the required SAP module expertise, and matches you with consultants based on their skills, ratings, availability, language preferences, and hourly rates.",
    "q2": "Are consultants verified?",
    "a2": "Yes, every consultant goes through a rigorous verification process including SAP certification validation, AI-based skills assessment, reference checks, and identity verification.",
    "q3": "What SAP modules are covered?",
    "a3": "We cover 20+ SAP modules including S/4HANA, ECC, BTP, SuccessFactors, Ariba, Fiori, Basis, Security/GRC, ABAP, and all functional modules (FI/CO, MM, SD, PP, QM, PM, PS, EWM, TM).",
    "q4": "Is Arabic language support available?",
    "a4": "Yes, the platform offers full Arabic RTL support, Arabic-speaking consultants, and localized content for the GCC market.",
    "q5": "How does billing work?",
    "a5": "We offer session-based billing, hourly rates, and fixed-price packages. Time is tracked automatically, VAT-ready invoices are generated, and payments are processed securely through multiple gateways."
  },
